<Layout title="Our Products - Makkeroni" lang="en">
  <h1>A Selection of Italian Products</h1>
  <p>At Makkeroni we carefully select every product so you can enjoy the authenticity and flavor of Italy at home.</p>

  <h2 id="pasta">Fresh and dried pasta</h2>
  <p>Pasta is one of the most authentic and beloved symbols of Italian cuisine. Unlike industrial pasta, artisanal pasta is made with durum wheat semolina, pure water and bronze-die extrusion, with slow drying at low temperatures.</p>
  <p><strong>Regional varieties:</strong> Gragnano IGP Artisanal Pasta, Orecchiette, Trofie, Pici, Busiate, Strangozzi.</p>

  <h2 id="coldcuts">Cold cuts</h2>
  <p>Cold cuts are a jewel of Italian gastronomy. We select artisanal cold cuts from small producers, with natural ingredients and no unnecessary additives.</p>
  <p><strong>Varieties:</strong> Prosciutto di San Daniele, Prosciutto di Parma, Roasted Culatello, Salame Milano, Salame Napoletano, Spianata Calabrese, Mortadella di Bologna IGP, Lardo di Colonnata, Capocollo, Salame Ventricina, Spicy Salsiccia.</p>

  <h2 id="cheeses">Italian cheeses</h2>
  <p>A carefully curated selection of Italian cheeses, authentic and of the finest quality, with personalized advice.</p>
  <p><strong>Varieties:</strong> Parmigiano Reggiano DOP, Pecorino Romano DOP, Fresh Ricotta, Salva Cremasco, Fontal, Pecorino Fiore Sardo, Provolone, Truffle Pecorino, Smoked Scamorza, Mozzarella di Bufala, Fiordilatte, Caciocavallo, Provolone del Monaco, Gorgonzola, Taleggio, Asiago, Burrata.</p>

  <h2 id="glutenfree">Gluten-free products</h2>
  <p>Gluten-free pasta produced in Italy with rice, corn and quinoa flours. Also: gluten-free cookies, corn snacks, bread and sweets.</p>

  <h2 id="preserves">Preserves and sauces</h2>
  <p>San Marzano DOP tomato, Pomodorino del Piennolo del Vesuvio DOP. Sauces: Genovese pesto, pesto rosso, pistachio and truffle pesto, ragù alla bolognese. Vegetables preserved in oil: artichokes, sun-dried tomatoes, olives, capers, eggplant.</p>

  <h2 id="coffee">Coffee</h2>
  <p>Brands: Kimbo, Passalacqua, Vergnano, Lavazza, Illy, Caffè Motta, Caffè Borbone. Formats: beans, ground, capsules compatible with Nespresso and Dolce Gusto.</p>

  <h2 id="wine">Wines, beers and spirits</h2>
  <p><strong>Reds:</strong> Chianti Riserva DOCG, Montepulciano DOC, Sangiovese DOC, Nero D'Avola DOC, Primitivo di Manduria, Negroamaro, Nebbiolo.</p>
  <p><strong>Whites:</strong> Pinot Grigio DOC, Greco di Tufo DOCG, Trebbiano d'Abruzzo.</p>
  <p><strong>Beers:</strong> Ichnusa Unfiltered, Peroni Nastro Azzurro.</p>
  <p><strong>Spirits:</strong> Aperol, Campari, Limoncello, Amaretto di Saronno, Grappa, Sambuca.</p>

  <p><a href="/en/contact">Contact us</a> for availability and prices.</p>
</Layout>
